{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the skies as a rocket-powered bear in <i>Bearplane</i>\u2014a whimsical, action-packed adventure loosely inspired by the legendary tale of Wojtek, the bear who served alongside the Polish army in World War II. Command this fearless furball as he battles dastardly foes with outrageous abilities, explosive power-ups, and a whole lot of midair mayhem.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ram! Roast! Roar! Victory awaits!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/f21124e184230f297ce029e7722f8666.poster.avif?t=1756383715\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/f21124e184230f297ce029e7722f8666.webm?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/f21124e184230f297ce029e7722f8666.mp4?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rain down righteous justice from above! Ram enemy aircraft into scrap metal, roast bad guys mid-flight with blazing jet flames, or belt out a sky-shaking roar that ejects foes straight from their cockpits. The skies won\u2019t know what hit \u2019em.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Suit up, power up, and look sharp!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/4752177b9b53b0ace78e99e6953f2cbd.poster.avif?t=1756383715\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/4752177b9b53b0ace78e99e6953f2cbd.webm?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/4752177b9b53b0ace78e99e6953f2cbd.mp4?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hero needs an arsenal... and flair! Equip bazookas, jousting lances, and other wild weapons of sky-bound destruction. Then top it all off with a tactical hat built for glory. Some hats supercharge your firepower, others give you the edge in snow, rain, or stormy skies. The right loadout turns you into a flying fortress!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From the makers of the world\u2019s first atomic breakfast.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/a3f5fa514ed4f81f09620c991d318b2d.poster.avif?t=1756383715\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/a3f5fa514ed4f81f09620c991d318b2d.webm?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/a3f5fa514ed4f81f09620c991d318b2d.mp4?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gobble Flappy Flakes, chug Nukey Nectar, and pop open a bottle of Honey Thunder Cola. These top-secret \u201cnutritional breakthroughs\u201d supercharge your mission with flapping flight, blistering speed, and brute strength. Side effects may include total domination. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/df9a06fc1d0f2e9a5520817a3d892085.poster.avif?t=1756383715\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/df9a06fc1d0f2e9a5520817a3d892085.webm?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/df9a06fc1d0f2e9a5520817a3d892085.mp4?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a controller and enlist a co-pilot! Player 2 joins the ranks as Rifle Rat, your brave, gun-toting sidekick. Join forces, double your firepower, and deliver freedom\u2014one explosion at a time.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Bearly Started","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3370980/5b5c5f4180ae654fe64dedd602f5970a19ea9a84.jpg"},{"name":"Clawing Ahead","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3370980/42ebdef03c5e8a68ae57a0b5a30f76b3ddb6efc5.jpg"},{"name":"Furry Fighter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3370980/c82087a0a9824fd2f30a3b2266ed9e1c8d3c26af.jpg"},{"name":"Rocket Roarer","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3370980/ba911d40f18e37e907263272aca40c26872fb421.jpg"},{"name":"Air Dominator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3370980/03347d8287caa76aea51cebee4345413bc33045b.jpg"},{"name":"Grizzly Guardian","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3370980/62c4def5986c445f21b84ce11455d2928d47948e.jpg"},{"name":"Sky Sovereign","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3370980/a8e9b776d42b35652f1aeebfe73bcef6f3611550.jpg"},{"name":"Alpha Aviator","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3370980/836152ba6bbc29406c33faf910fbeae1c99a430f.jpg"},{"name":"Ursine Overlord","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3370980/ecf43f0e2e3f1f952236e53a02e92516b2431b9b.jpg"},{"name":"Ursine Legend","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3370980/d48af02954e6f924a1e3cef2a093eb8620c223d8.jpg"}],"total":20},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3370980?t=1756383715","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/0a1c8fa362c27fe1e4bbded9d483c860aee81450/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756383715","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/9a51217cb98b9813622871606bec3932987201a5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756383715","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/9a51217cb98b9813622871606bec3932987201a5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756383715","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Bearplane is a cartoony action game with frequent, stylized violence and blood. You\u2019ll be blasting through hordes of bad guys in mid-air dogfights, with splashes of red on impact and occasional dismemberment effects. There is no sexual content, drug use, or self-harm \u2014 just over-the-top, cartoonish carnage and non-stop airborne combat."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take to the skies as a rocket-powered bear in <i>Bearplane</i>\u2014a whimsical, action-packed adventure loosely inspired by the legendary tale of Wojtek, the bear who served alongside the Polish army in World War II. Command this fearless furball as he battles dastardly foes with outrageous abilities, explosive power-ups, and a whole lot of midair mayhem.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Ram! Roast! Roar! Victory awaits!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/f21124e184230f297ce029e7722f8666.poster.avif?t=1756383715\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/f21124e184230f297ce029e7722f8666.webm?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/f21124e184230f297ce029e7722f8666.mp4?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rain down righteous justice from above! Ram enemy aircraft into scrap metal, roast bad guys mid-flight with blazing jet flames, or belt out a sky-shaking roar that ejects foes straight from their cockpits. The skies won\u2019t know what hit \u2019em.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Suit up, power up, and look sharp!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/4752177b9b53b0ace78e99e6953f2cbd.poster.avif?t=1756383715\" width=616 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/4752177b9b53b0ace78e99e6953f2cbd.webm?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/4752177b9b53b0ace78e99e6953f2cbd.mp4?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every hero needs an arsenal... and flair! Equip bazookas, jousting lances, and other wild weapons of sky-bound destruction. Then top it all off with a tactical hat built for glory. Some hats supercharge your firepower, others give you the edge in snow, rain, or stormy skies. The right loadout turns you into a flying fortress!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From the makers of the world\u2019s first atomic breakfast.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/a3f5fa514ed4f81f09620c991d318b2d.poster.avif?t=1756383715\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/a3f5fa514ed4f81f09620c991d318b2d.webm?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/a3f5fa514ed4f81f09620c991d318b2d.mp4?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gobble Flappy Flakes, chug Nukey Nectar, and pop open a bottle of Honey Thunder Cola. These top-secret \u201cnutritional breakthroughs\u201d supercharge your mission with flapping flight, blistering speed, and brute strength. Side effects may include total domination. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Co-op Chaos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/df9a06fc1d0f2e9a5520817a3d892085.poster.avif?t=1756383715\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/df9a06fc1d0f2e9a5520817a3d892085.webm?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/extras/df9a06fc1d0f2e9a5520817a3d892085.mp4?t=1756383715\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab a controller and enlist a co-pilot! Player 2 joins the ranks as Rifle Rat, your brave, gun-toting sidekick. Join forces, double your firepower, and deliver freedom\u2014one explosion at a time.</p>","developers":["Matthew Burton"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3370980/55a5fedbcffe52f8b6238e4a245cd7b49bfb41ff/header.jpg?t=1756383715","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Matthew Burton. All rights reserved. Bearplane\u2122 and Atomic Mills\u2122 are trademarks of Matthew Burton.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 or SteamOS 3.0<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core 2.5 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Intel HD Graphics 4000 or equivalent (OpenGL 3.2+)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Integrated or dedicated sound card<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Supports both keyboard/mouse and controller. Runs great on Steam Deck.</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3370980/1377370525/5e62d06088883060fd0f513f64b4da7806af5617/1756240189/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756242569","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3370980/1377370525/5e62d06088883060fd0f513f64b4da7806af5617/1756240189/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756242569","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3370980/1377370525/5e62d06088883060fd0f513f64b4da7806af5617/1756240189/hls